      "id": "c68e777f-3101-4019-8d4c-e28086a1619d",
      "name": "Модель OpenAI"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"category\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"student_support\",\n        \"academic\",\n        \"sales\",\n        \"billing\",\n        \"spam\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"priority\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"P1\", \"P2\", \"P3\", \"P4\"]\n    },\n    \"owner\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"student_success_lead\",\n        \"academic_coordinator\",\n        \"sales_lead\",\n        \"finance_lead\",\n        null\n      ]\n    },\n    \"sla_minutes\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"enum\": [30, 120, 1440, 2880]\n    },\n    \"reasoning\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 20\n    },\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 5\n    },\n    \"customer_sentiment\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"positive\",\n        \"neutral\",\n        \"frustrated\",\n        \"angry\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"category\",\n    \"priority\",\n    \"owner\",\n    \"sla_minutes\",\n    \"reasoning\",\n    \"summary\",\n    \"customer_sentiment\"\n  ]\n}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -224,
        -288
      ],
      "id": "d2ed427c-ba10-4429-b57a-aa42bc26f327",
      "name": "Парсер структурованої відповіді",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Перевіряє, що відповідь AI містить усі обов’язкові поля, дозволені значення та правильні типи даних. Поле owner допускає значення null для категорії spam."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.output ?? $json;\nconst ctx = $('Збір контексту тікета').item.json;\n\nconst zone = 'Europe/Madrid';\nconst workStart = 9;\nconst workEnd = 19;\n\n// Сюди можна додати офіційні вихідні:\n// const holidays = new Set(['2026-12-25', '2027-01-01']);\nconst holidays = new Set([]);\n\nfunction isBusinessDay(dt) {\n  return dt.weekday <= 5 && !holidays.has(dt.toISODate());\n}\n\nfunction nextBusinessMoment(dt) {\n  let cursor = dt.setZone(zone);\n\n  while (!isBusinessDay(cursor)) {\n    cursor = cursor\n      .plus({ days: 1 })\n      .startOf('day')\n      .set({ hour: workStart });\n  }\n\n  if (cursor.hour < workStart) {\n    return cursor.startOf('day').set({ hour: workStart });\n  }\n\n  if (cursor.hour >= workEnd) {\n    cursor = cursor\n      .plus({ days: 1 })\n      .startOf('day')\n      .set({ hour: workStart });\n\n    while (!isBusinessDay(cursor)) {\n      cursor = cursor.plus({ days: 1 });\n    }\n  }\n\n  return cursor;\n}\n\nfunction addBusinessMinutes(start, minutes) {\n  let cursor = nextBusinessMoment(start);\n  let remaining = Number(minutes);\n\n  while (remaining > 0) {\n    cursor = nextBusinessMoment(cursor);\n\n    const end = cursor\n      .startOf('day')\n      .set({ hour: workEnd });\n\n    const available = Math.max(\n      0,\n      Math.floor(end.diff(cursor, 'minutes').minutes)\n    );\n\n    const step = Math.min(remaining, available);\n\n    cursor = cursor.plus({ minutes: step });\n    remaining -= step;\n\n    if (remaining > 0) {\n      cursor = nextBusinessMoment(\n        cursor\n          .plus({ days: 1 })\n          .startOf('day')\n          .set({ hour: workStart })\n      );\n    }\n  }\n\n  return cursor;\n}\n\nconst created = DateTime.fromISO(ctx.created_at, { zone });\nconst deadline = addBusinessMinutes(created, raw.sla_minutes);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ticket_id: ctx.ticket_id,\n    created_at: ctx.created_at,\n    from_email: ctx.from_email,\n    subject: ctx.subject,\n    category: raw.category,\n    priority: raw.priority,\n    owner: raw.owner,\n    sla_minutes: Number(raw.sla_minutes),\n    sla_deadline: deadline.toISO(),\n    status: raw.category === 'spam' ? 'filtered' : 'open',\n    summary: raw.summary,\n    reasoning: raw.reasoning,\n    sentiment: raw.customer_sentiment,\n    thread_link: ctx.thread_link,\n    last_escalation_level: -1,\n    last_escalated_at: '',\n    first_response_at: '',\n    resolved_at: '',\n    classifier_version: 'supportflow-v1'\n  }\n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -512
      ],
      "id": "b0704a64-6cbc-4b7c-81bd-86e1ed5ee623",
      "name": "Формування тікета та SLA",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Розраховує SLA у робочі дні з 09:00 до 19:00 в часовому поясі Europe/Madrid. Формує повний 19-польовий запис тікета для збереження в Google Sheets, подальшого контролю SLA та життєвого циклу."
    },
